    "project": "Lang",
    "summary": "BooleanUtils.toBoolean() - invalid drop-thru in case statement causes StringIndexOutOfBoundsException",
    "description": "The method BooleanUtils.toBoolean() has a case statement; case 3 drops through to case 4; this can cause StringIndexOutOfBoundsException, for example with the test:\n\nassertEquals(false, BooleanUtils.toBoolean(\"tru\"));\n\nThe end of case 3 should return false.\n\nPatch to follow for source and unit test."
